{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "cd3710b0c975ac6c01e1a74afc1f073918ab5097feb213a32c2852b732cbc626", "ja": "童心にかえろう", "zh": "重拾童心吧", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b7d4fb829032d2fcdc55d6bb5c95b34679b7b7fa10f05b83036b56d8d1105c79", "ja": "公演が無事終わり、骨休めに温泉へとやって\n来た一同。真は公演を振り返り、アイドルに\nなってよかったと改めて実感する。そして\n千鶴、エレナ、瑞希と合流し、北東エリアの\n冬を思い思いに楽しむのだった。", "zh": "公演顺利结束后，大家来到温泉休息。真回顾着这次公演，再次真切地感受到，成为偶像真是太好了。随后，她与千鹤、艾蕾娜、瑞希会合，尽情享受着东北地区的冬日时光。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "024e7adc44f6e22fde5a5fc9892cca54d1074e7fbbfce8718164807758e97f8d", "ja": "（ひとつの公演が終わり、骨休めに温泉に来た。\nみんな雪を見に外に行ったけど、真が見当たらないな）", "zh": "（一场公演结束后，大家来温泉休息。大家都出去看雪了，可是没看到真啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_07_1001_p", "source_sha256": "bcf02db1fede4f64702ee6167a3372a79b1aee95a67d34b72255b687258c1494", "ja": "真、ここにいたのか。\nみんな、外に行っちゃったぞ。", "zh": "真，原来你在这里。\n大家都去外面了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_07_1002_006mak", "source_sha256": "81fa9bb8211eabfba67da31ab329c42d74d9e199491a6b684c47db83213ede9d", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！\nボクを探しに来てくれたんですか？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n您是来找我的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_07_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "3eef667ddf3d70958d2a94b3fa584280b893286f951c4e2a3b4a3a9921813d45", "ja": "すみません。ちょっと、考え事っていうか……\n昨日の公演を思い出しちゃって。", "zh": "对不起。我只是有点在想事情……\n不知不觉想起了昨天的演出。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_07_1004_006mak", "source_sha256": "dd5078b1429c64255e46c42de581608705c6e70d94ce1e5ee5a73ad09e2d3478", "ja": "みんなの声援が大きくて、あったかくて、\nすっごくいいライブでしたよね。", "zh": "大家的欢呼声既响亮又温暖，真的是一场特别棒的演出呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_07_1005_p", "source_sha256": "e414f203cf12a5c61f63ab6790febb61a265e5b81b908de933d97943f394ec61", "ja": "ああ。見てるこっちまで、\nあったかい気持ちになったよ。", "zh": "是啊，连看着演出的我，也感到心里暖暖的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_07_1006_006mak", "source_sha256": "455c609b20ebddb524f4db8e7e4b50df239f6afaa5e1cc272b044699e311e6ae", "ja": "合唱団の子どもたちも、いっぱい頑張ってくれて、\nそれから……", "zh": "合唱团的孩子们也都很努力，\n还有就是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_07_1007_006mak", "source_sha256": "e84619c24c5cb3746e206520b3527bf10f8ea08ec1f1a85c509dc2c7d6fa75ec", "ja": "ボクみたいになりたいって言ってくれる子もいて、\nうれしかったなぁ……。", "zh": "还有孩子说想成为像我一样的人，真的很开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_07_1008_006mak", "source_sha256": "c0beb834612686d9daf81c4bcdd2f9e809c47437c6223ef010a79812e7c194d9", "ja": "ボク……アイドルになって、本当によかったです！\nもっともっと、頑張らないとって思いました！", "zh": "我……真的很庆幸自己成为了偶像！\n我觉得自己必须更加努力才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_07_1009_p", "source_sha256": "27bc22e03ecdbfe4ca1c95a3615de60e6093c860557824df1cc306e4e4ead362", "ja": "うん、そうだな。\nこれからもよろしくな、真！", "zh": "嗯，是啊。\n今后也请多指教了，真！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_07_1010_006mak", "source_sha256": "f6470ddae910f8418ae11f68c2f32b45213c7c1409d56ce7121a9af06ee06498", "ja": "はいっ！　……あっ、そろそろ行かないと。\n今日は、思いっきり遊びますよ～！　へへっ♪", "zh": "好的！……啊，差不多该走了。今天要尽情玩个痛快哦～！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_07_1011_038chz", "source_sha256": "e78e0cecdaf144524d21890e148300fa1e9c6fa29d351068f649b5b473d0d85c", "ja": "よいしょ、よいしょ……ふぅ。雪だるまの胴体は、\nやっぱりこのくらい大きくないといけませんわね。", "zh": "嘿咻，嘿咻……呼。雪人的身体，\n果然还是得有这么大才行呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_07_1012_044miz", "source_sha256": "d02c7dd2de23e8a408f19c89098d38fdcaf50e16fa94e6de3ebd264ac2bf99fa", "ja": "はい、どっしりしていてとても強そうです。\n次は頭の部分を……。", "zh": "是的，敦实稳重，看起来非常强壮。\n接下来是头部……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_07_1013_018ele", "source_sha256": "9772d52398037e6e2da5eb74c8a1896687162bffe636df81f19ecef2b2d80b94", "ja": "ミズキ、頭にこのバケツ載せようヨ～！\nこれがあれば帽子もばっちりだヨ！", "zh": "瑞希，把这个水桶戴在头上吧～！\n有了这个，帽子就完美啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_07_1014_006mak", "source_sha256": "a735589cd0bf14030b2d772a1f5d43e0fa43cf715e82d67e9421f483504885ab", "ja": "みんなー！　お待たせー！", "zh": "大家久等了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_07_1015_018ele", "source_sha256": "ea234225bf11b709982042fed4c9879ca75fc89b25e85a875a756a4b30174f76", "ja": "あっ、マコト！　やっときたー！", "zh": "啊，真！你终于来了——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_07_1016_038chz", "source_sha256": "40b6c5a839a48ffb787c2464d77e96a817634503fb1f12c4c644af5e0a9ac321", "ja": "遅いですわよ、真。\nもう、雪だるまが完成してしまいますわ。", "zh": "你来得太晚了，真。\n雪人都快堆好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_07_1017_006mak", "source_sha256": "5be4bed85a21d7737d5d74dcb353b92954889dcf3af3ee9d22bfdf63987ae2a2", "ja": "わ～、ホントだ！\nじゃあボクは、雪玉を作っておこうかな！", "zh": "哇～真的耶！\n那我先来做雪球吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_07_1018_044miz", "source_sha256": "3e2bc214aa89bf465288cfcf6251da925f65c3f31bb58f13fe168ce74526ab4b", "ja": "菊地さん、雪合戦をするつもりですね。\n熱い戦いが、始まる予感がします。……ワクワク。", "zh": "菊地小姐是打算打雪仗吧。\n感觉一场激烈的大战就要开始了。……好期待。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_07_1019_018ele", "source_sha256": "3279af077fad1ccc3a122e0deae7e912619ca17b1311981560ff6bb66803d09b", "ja": "ワーイ！　ついに雪合戦だネ！\nワタシも雪玉作るヨ～♪", "zh": "哇——！终于要打雪仗了呢！\n我也来做雪球哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_07_1020_p", "source_sha256": "bc6eef26fd60e7cd1b767b32487cda1ccbe3f7c82295e88bcbd81950c92ab2ca", "ja": "あっ、みんな！　遊んでるところ悪いんだけど、\nもう少しで食事の準備ができるって、女将さんが……。", "zh": "啊，大家！不好意思打扰你们玩耍了，不过老板娘说，饭菜马上就准备好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_07_1021_038chz", "source_sha256": "62ce9f304afc1fb8495e756a1f70d17c7d38c0f7a6c2bd757a110d55c24fd876", "ja": "まあ、もうそんな時間ですの？\nでは冷める前に、お料理をいただきましょうか。", "zh": "哎呀，已经到这个时间了吗？\n那我们在饭菜凉掉之前用餐吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_07_1022_006mak", "source_sha256": "8b6384c1483e659bb5af728bef6ccb1d8f7f1ee86c791390c5b38b21c6bf4c41", "ja": "そうですね。北東エリアはおいしいものが\nたくさんありそうだから、楽しみだなー！", "zh": "是啊。东北地区好像有很多美味的东西，真让人期待啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_07_1023_038chz", "source_sha256": "0901b6360076b225a6ddf9619ef32f46de865b5e2521f99ba7d7c1f88adec386", "ja": "ええ。お肉や野菜もおいしいですし、\n海の幸も豊富ですものね。", "zh": "是啊。肉类和蔬菜都很美味，海鲜也很丰富呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_07_1024_p", "source_sha256": "9354b8ccfb69a74e2e01de76ce3946439add5577f0974f4821fac7a703342a0f", "ja": "食事をする場所は……あれ？\nどこで食べるんだったかな？", "zh": "吃饭的地方……咦？\n是在哪里吃来着？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_07_1025_038chz", "source_sha256": "982f3cb7382baf4e63611febd6cbb29bd98ec552c4e3f64c1fc8d9ea217fadd8", "ja": "それなら、旅館のパンフレットで見ましたわ。\nかまくらの中でいただけるそうですわよ。", "zh": "这个我在旅馆的宣传册上看到过了。\n听说可以在雪屋里用餐呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_07_1026_006mak", "source_sha256": "5ad838ffd23330cc23f993d2fef0af21b2a68f153dab69fecca9b5d6f7d7d48a", "ja": "えっ、かまくらの中で！？\nすごい！", "zh": "咦，在雪屋里吃！？\n好厉害！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_07_1027_018ele", "source_sha256": "760556ed3108c637df6e24796d16dd2371d89727a981a40f1888bce909aa58eb", "ja": "ヤッター！\nかまくらでゴハン、楽しそうだネ！", "zh": "太好了！\n在雪屋里吃饭，感觉好有意思呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_07_1028_044miz", "source_sha256": "56d00f723ebacceb72e16b6691a3855416199098992c77efa5633fadab37e784", "ja": "はい。雪の世界で味わう食事……。\n特別な思い出になりそうです。わくわく。", "zh": "嗯。在冰雪世界中享用美食……一定会成为一段特别的回忆。真让人期待。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_07_1029_006mak", "source_sha256": "bb7352e58ee1c1784add8aeb1e43d458e89458b597c2ece21521d4a9d6bf8f9e", "ja": "あー、話してたら、お腹空いてきちゃった！\n早く行きましょうよ、{$P$}！", "zh": "啊——聊着聊着，我都饿了！快点走吧，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_07_1030_p", "source_sha256": "3e6ce919b272dc8b0b0cc942b05f3c7a0a8e09dafd36d204ddbacf2175c93cc8", "ja": "（寒さも忘れるくらい、あたたかい公演だったな。\n子ども達との交流も、いい経験になったはずだ）", "zh": "（这场温暖的公演让我连寒冷都忘了。和孩子们交流，也一定会是一次很好的经历。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_07_1031_p", "source_sha256": "e436ab8b9cfd3b66359af9d5c379fe63e31977925f2355dbdc1860207eb195e7", "ja": "（みんなに憧れてアイドルになったという子が、\n近い将来本当に現れるかもしれない……楽しみだな！）", "zh": "（说不定在不久的将来，真的会有憧憬着大家而成为偶像的孩子出现……真让人期待啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
